  "poe": {
    "budgetW": 1480,
    "sourceUrl": "https://webresources.ruckuswireless.com/pdf/datasheets/ds-icx-family.pdf",
    "note": "1480 W with two power supplies. Only the first 16 ports are PoH (90 W); the other 32 are 802.3af/at at 30 W class."
  },
  "sourceUrl": "https://webresources.ruckuswireless.com/pdf/datasheets/ds-icx-family.pdf",
  "notes": "Datasheet: 16x 100/1000 Mbps/2.5 Gbps RJ-45 PoH ports, 32x 10/100/1000 Mbps RJ-45 PoE+ ports, 1480 W PoE budget with two power supplies, 8x 1/10 GbE uplink/stacking SFP/SFP+. Z-Series column: 304 Gbps switching capacity, 480 Gbps aggregate stack bandwidth. Hardware guide: the eight SFP+ are 1/2/1-1/2/8 on this model (not slot 3 as on the -24/-48), the first four can stack and the last four are uplink/user only; 1/2/1 and 1/2/3 come up at 10G and the rest default to 1G until the 8X10GR licence is applied. Two hot-swap power supplies and two fan trays; fanless operation is not supported. 48 copper ports total, not 64: the 16 multigigabit and 32 gigabit ports are the whole downlink set."
}
